---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const updated = 'May 23, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy | Will Mau"
  description="A short, honest page about what happens to your information when you use willmau.com or subscribe to the civic updates list."
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <SiteHeader />
      <div class="wrap page-hero__inner">
        <p class="kicker page-hero__kicker" data-reveal>Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="page-hero__title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          What happens<br />to your data.
        </h1>
        <p class="page-hero__note" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          Short, honest, no legalese. Last updated {updated}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="essay">
      <div class="wrap essay__wrap">
        <div class="essay__col">

          <p class="essay__lede" data-reveal>
            This site collects almost nothing about you. Here is the
            complete picture.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>What I collect and why</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            The only personal information I collect through this site is
            what you give me when you sign up for the civic updates list:
            your email address, your first name if you choose to share it,
            and which page of the site you signed up on. That information
            is used to send you civic updates, roughly five emails a year.
            Nothing more.
          </p>
          <p data-reveal>
            If you email me directly at
            <a href="mailto:will@willmau.com">will@willmau.com</a>, I keep
            that email the way anyone keeps email. I do not add you to the
            list without your asking.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>Where your data lives</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            The civic updates list is hosted by
            <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MailerLite</a>,
            an email service used by tens of thousands of senders
            worldwide. Your email address and name live there, not on
            willmau.com. You can read
            <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MailerLite&rsquo;s privacy policy</a>
            if you want their full picture.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>What I do not do</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            I do not sell your information. I do not share it with anyone.
            I do not run ads against it. I do not trade it. The list exists
            so I can occasionally send you something worth knowing about
            Schalmont and the board, and that is the whole purpose.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>Cookies and tracking</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            This site uses no tracking cookies. No Google Analytics, no
            Facebook pixel, no advertising or behavioral tracking. The
            only Google product connected to the site is Search Console,
            which reads Google&rsquo;s own search data to show me what
            queries bring people here. It never touches your browser and
            never sets a cookie.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>Removing your information</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            Every email I send has an unsubscribe link at the bottom. One
            click removes you from the list. If you would like your data
            deleted entirely, email me at
            <a href="mailto:will@willmau.com">will@willmau.com</a> and I
            will remove you from MailerLite and confirm.
          </p>

          <h2 class="essay__h2" data-reveal>Questions</h2>
          <p data-reveal>
            Email me at
            <a href="mailto:will@willmau.com">will@willmau.com</a>. I read
            every reply.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .essay {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 1rem + 4vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 5rem);
  }
  .essay__wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .essay__col { max-width: 36rem; width: 100%; }
  .essay__col p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1rem + 0.25vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
  }
  .essay__lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.05rem + 0.7vw, 1.45rem) !important;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4 !important;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 2rem !important;
  }
  .essay__col a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green-deep);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .essay__col a:hover { color: var(--green-deep); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .essay__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.15rem + 0.6vw, 1.6rem);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 2.4rem 0 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
</style>
